<h1>Examples tour</h1>
<p>Twenty-six checked-in example projects double as executable engine probes. If several examples repeat the same workaround, that is evidence of a missing engine feature.</p>
<p>Run any example:</p>
<pre><code>demi validate examples/minimal_3d
demi run --project examples/minimal_3d/demi.project.json</code></pre>

