<h2>Using examples as probes</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Validate before running: <code>demi validate examples/&lt;name&gt;</code>.</li>
  <li>Compare expanded documents: <code>demi scene diff</code>, <code>demi scene expand</code>.</li>
  <li>Profile with the example's own scene to get comparable numbers.</li>
  <li>Android-qualify with a physical device: <code>demi test android --project examples/minimal_2d_android --serial &lt;device&gt;</code>.</li>
</ul>
<p>When an example needs a package (health, destruction weapons, Kenney textures), install it first with <code>demi package install</code> from that project directory.</p>